  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-Sectoral Humanitarian Assistance to IDPs in Konso, SNNPR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to contribute towards the improvement of the living conditions and protection of IDPs population in Konso (Ethiopia) through a multi-sectoral Shelter, Water, Sanitation and Hygiene (WASH), Nutrition, Protection, and education emergency response that ensures a healthy, safe, and dignified living environment.</narrative>
  </description>
